<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I’d rather have Jesus than men’s applause,</l><l>I’d rather be faithful to His dear cause;</l><l>I’d rather have Jesus than world-wide fame,</l><l>I’d rather be true to His holy name.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
